WEBVTT

00:09:28.335 --> 00:09:30.694
David pravi: "Hočem se boriti z Goljatom,"

00:09:30.694 --> 00:09:32.515
in Savel mu hoče dati oklep,

00:09:32.515 --> 00:09:35.242
saj misli: "Oh, ko praviš 'boriti',

00:09:35.242 --> 00:09:38.509
misliš na 'rokoborbo',

00:09:38.509 --> 00:09:40.697
pehoto proti pehoti."

00:09:40.697 --> 00:09:43.671
A David sploh nima nobenih pričakovanj.

00:09:43.671 --> 00:09:46.222
Ne bo se boril na tak način. Zakaj bi se le?

00:09:46.222 --> 00:09:49.230
On je pastir. Ves čas je s pračo

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:53.443
ščitil čredo pred levi in volkovi.

00:09:53.443 --> 00:09:55.193
V tem je njegova moč.

00:09:55.193 --> 00:09:57.725
Tu imamo torej pastirja,

00:09:57.725 --> 00:09:59.764
ki ima izkušnje z morilskim orožjem,

00:09:59.764 --> 00:10:02.158
ki se zoperstavi okornemu velikanu,